                            ErrorCode.CONCURRENT_MODIFICATION,
                            "同 requestId 的前序请求失败，请重试: " + requestId);
                }
                record = repository.find(requestId);
            }
            try {
                Thread.sleep(PLACEHOLDER_POLL_MILLIS);
            } catch (InterruptedException e) {
                Thread.currentThread().interrupt();
                throw new ApiException(ErrorCode.CONCURRENT_MODIFICATION, "等待同 requestId 请求时被中断");
            }
